    ],
    "text": "THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES ACT, No. 2 OF 1996",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      369.13,
      546.88,
      404.2
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development under Section 61(1) (t) of theFisheries and Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of 1996, for the purpose of implementing conservation and managementmeasures adopted by the Indian Ocean Tuna Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      417.13,
      542.76,
      476.2
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA AMARAWEERA,Minister of Fisheries and AquaticResources Development.Colomobo,3oth November, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      276.81,
      485.05,
      326.02,
      496.12
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      509.05,
      546.9,
      532.12
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as minimum standards for the citizen of Sri Lanka engaged in fishing operationsin foreign flagged fishing boats Regulations No. 0f 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      540.97,
      546.92,
      564.04
    ],
    "text": "2. Any citizen of Sri Lanka who desires to serve in a foreign flagged fishing vessel which operates within theExclusive Economic Zone of Sri Lanka, High seas, or within the Exclusive Economic Zone of other coastal states shall :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      105.69,
      573.13,
      267.47,
      584.2
    ],
    "text": "(i) be of not less than 18 years of age ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      102.57,
      593.05,
      546.89,
      628.12
    ],
    "text": "(ii) obtain an identity card issued by the Director General of the Department of Fisheries and Aquatic Resourcesto prove his identity in addition to the National Identity Card issued by the Commissioner General ofRegistration of Persons ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      99.69,
      636.97,
      546.87,
      660.04
    ],
    "text": "(iii) not be employed by a person who has been found to be engaged in illegal, unreported and unregulatedfishing under the vessel monitoring systems maintained by the respective state.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      672.97,
      546.86,
      708.04
    ],
    "text": "3. No recruitement Agency or Institute shall employ and citizen of Sri Lanka on behalf of an employer who hasbeen found to be engaged in illegal, unreported and unregulated fishing under the vessel monitoring system of the respectivestate.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.77,
      717.13,
      546.87,
      740.2
    ],
    "text": "4. (i) Any person who desires to be employed by a foreign flagged fishing vessel shall make and application fora permit substantially in the form specified in the Schedule I hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      49.15,
      83.29,
      508.29,
      104.49
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2015'12'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 14.12.20152A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabldBold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
