  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.95,
      118.09,
      540.04,
      129.16
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Every permit issued under this regulation shall be substantially in the form specified in Schedule II hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.95,
      142.09,
      540.01,
      165.16
    ],
    "text": "5. The Director-General shall issue a permit only on fulfillment of the requirements specified in the regulation2 hereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      47.95,
      178.09,
      540.01,
      201.16
    ],
    "text": "6. No person shall serve in any foreign flagged fishing boat unless under the authority of a permit issued by theDirector General of Fisheries for that purpose.",
